## 1. Definitions

- **"Code"** means the software in this repository, including but not
  limited to `minimal/minimal_caf.py` and its accompanying scripts,
  documentation files in source form, and any modifications thereof.
- **"Papers"** means the scientific manuscripts in `papers/` (PDF and any
  HTML or source forms), including their abstracts, figures, tables, and
  Data Availability statements.
- **"Commercial Use"** means any use intended for or directed toward
  commercial advantage or monetary compensation, including but not limited
  to: integrating the Code or Papers into a commercial product or service;
  selling, licensing, or distributing copies for a fee; or employing the
  Code or Papers in the production of goods or services offered for sale.
  Commercial Use **excludes** academic research, teaching, scholarly
  publication, verification/reproduction of reported results, and
  non-profit evaluation.
- **"Hosted or Managed Service"** means providing the Code (original or
  modified, in whole or in part) to third parties as a service, where the
  service provides those third parties with access to any substantial set
  of the features or functionality of the Code, whether or not for a fee.
- **"Evaluation"** means use of the Code solely to assess its
  functionality and performance, in non-production systems, for a
  continuous period of no more than ninety (90) days, by or on behalf of
  a single legal entity, without integration into any product or service
  offered to third parties.
- **"Licensor"** means Li Pin.
- **"You"** means any person or entity exercising the permissions granted
  below.

